    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your theories are broad in scope, allowing you to apply them to things partially connected to your subject.</p>\n<p>When you begin a theory on a creature, you can also use the theory's base ability and breakthroughs on creatures that share the same type (and at least one subtype, if any) as the subject of your theory.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
